@base = http://localhost:8787
@adminUser = admin
@adminPassword = CHANGE_ME_AFTER_FIRST_LOGIN

### Santé API
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Connexion Admin (mot de passe initial à changer dès la première connexion)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{adminUser}}","password":"{{adminPassword}}"}

### Vérifier le rôle et les permissions du compte connecté
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me

### Liste des comptes (Admin uniquement)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users

### Créer un utilisateur (Admin uniquement)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"agent_ptf","password":"MotDePasseTemporaire!2026","firstName":"Agent","lastName":"PTF","permissions":{"dashboard_read":true,"matrix_read":true,"matrix_write":true,"partners_read":true,"partners_write":false,"activities_read":true,"activities_write":false,"indicators_read":true,"indicators_write":false,"exports":false}}

### Vérifier la vitrine publique sans session
GET {{base}}/api/public/showcase

### Déconnexion
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}
